Lite Switcher - third party data

The language packs in LiteraryLanguages/ contain frequency data derived from:

- FrequencyWords by Hermit Dave (https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords),
  content licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0, built from OpenSubtitles (https://www.opensubtitles.org,
  OPUS). Used for the English, Russian and Ukrainian packs (the 2018 lists).

The derived files (words.fst, ngram3.bin) are provided under the same licence, see LICENSE-DATA.
The program code is licensed separately (see the license field in Cargo.toml).

The sources and licences of every data source are described in docs/data-sources.md.
